# Forum Thread About Reader Fixtures

## Original Post

I am testing a reader with pages that have multiple authors and repeated signatures.

## Reply

Try adding fixtures for comments, quotes, and code snippets so regressions become obvious.

> Snapshots should stay stable when unrelated timing changes.

## Maintainer Reply

The final result should keep useful discussion text and not overfit to one article layout.
